{
  "$comment": "Fixed scenario for the Procurement Coordinator Agent golden-case evaluation. Run by backend/tests/StockPilot.Procurement.Tests/AgenticAI/ProcurementGoldenCaseTests.cs. Every case starts from this catalog; a case may override the budget. Expected values are exact: the agent must reproduce them.",
  "catalog": {
